h to Dashboard and risking a click on some other control's tab bar. The pick is stored on the reused #headsupdisplay host keyed by peer uuid, so it survives the panel's rebuild-on-refresh but resets with the page. The page-scope half of the hazard is still open: the shared app ui initNavbar sweeps 'selected' off every .tab-content under the page root (the Add Connection tabs blank the panel's content) — shared data/app code, deferred to Marc.\", \"tags\": \"peer.headsup,peer.peer,tabs,buildControls,1b\", \"source\": {\"lib\": \"peer\", \"ctl\": \"headsup\", \"facet\": \"js\", \"hash\": \"e7118e6be3f9b4eb\"}, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"time\": 1793532074730},\n{\"claim\": \"The panel's update chips must size to their content: headsup's own .ispos rule made each chip an inline-block stretched to calc(100% - 20px), which clipped the ✓ over the version and stretched the ⚠ chip; the dialog's content-sized chips are the model (Phase 1b).\", \"detail\": \"Commit 90a6539f (peers-app-fixes). Symptom seen in session 2's shots: 'app v123 ➤ 12✓' with the ✓ covering the digits, and '⚠ different author' chips with a wide internal gap. Keep panel chips free of fixed or minimum widths; if a chip misrenders, check headsup's own css overrides before suspecting the shared chip markup that peer.peer's updater builds.\", \"tags\": \"peer.headsup,chips,css,1b\", \"source\": {\"lib\": \"peer\", \"ctl\": \"headsup\", \"facet\": \"css\", \"hash\": \"6f9278b25a6f9d78\"}, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"time\": 1793532078841},\n{\"end\": true}]\n","patch_id":"p63","time":1793540437889},{"author":"claude","facet":"css","label":"7b fix-up: key/lock rows join the Info rows' 29px rhythm","new":"/* 7b fix-up: one rhythm for every Info row. The kit's .icon-small-white\n   is a 32px box (20px glyph + 6px inset), which made the key/lock rows\n   42px apart against the text rows' 29. A 20px box with no inset draws\n   the SAME 20px glyph at the text rows' height, glyph left edge on the\n   label column (so the old -6px inset pull-back goes too). */\n.hudpanel .hudinfolabel .icon-small-white {\n  width: 20px;\n  height: 20px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin-left: 0;\n}","old":".hudpanel .hudinfolabel .icon-small-white {\n  margin-left: -6px;\n}","patch_id":"p64","time":1793541480392},{"author":"claude","facet":"css","label":"7b: big dashboard tiles reflow inside the resizable panel","new":".inline.big{\n  width:600px;\n  height:450px;\n  /* 7b: the panel is resizable down to 360px — a big dashboard tile\n     caps at the panel's inner width instead of holding 600px. */\n  max-width:100%;\n}","old":".inline.big{\n  width:600px;\n  height:450px;\n}","patch_id":"p65","time":1793541630880}]},"id":"xwuykz183948a6aecr5_patches","readers":[],"time":1793541630880,"username":"system","writers":[]}